    "text": "A <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> circuit behaves like a clamped harmonic oscillator. Comparing it with a physical spring-mass damped oscillator having damping constant <math><mi>&#39;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#39;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi></mi></math> the correct equivalence would be:",
